<title>USA: Sierra Health sets stock buy-back.</title>
<headline>Sierra Health sets stock buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sierra Health Services Inc Tuesday said its Board of Directors authorized a stock repurchase program of up to $25 million, representing about five percent of the stock's market capitalization.</p>
<p>The shares, to be purchased on the open market, will be held as treasury stock and used for general corporate purposes. At the end of March the company had 17,849 shares outstanding.</p>
